    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A bright one bedroom apartment on the third floor of Irishtown Central. The property comprises kitchen/living room, double bedroom and bathroom. There is also a cloakroom and attic space storage off the kitchen. \r\n\r\nThe property has the benefit of vaulted ceilings and skylights in the main living space which offer a bright open space. The property has recently been painted and is ready for immediate sale. \r\n\r\nThe property is located in the centre of Athlone with Golden Island Shopping Centre opposite the subject property.  \r\n\r\nTo arrange a viewing please contact Kathy on 090 6489000."
      },
